guide.nexustech.page.inicio.3=In Contents, tap a chapter. If it is not shown, use < or > to change the list; << and >> go to its beginning and end. Inside a chapter, < and > move through pages and parts; tap Contents to return.
guide.nexustech.page.inicio.4=Machine stopped? Check power, correct input and amount, output space and whether it is enabled. Check loaded chunks and permissions; for structures, check the assembly.
guide.nexustech.page.energia.5=Rates while conditions are met: simple solar 20 FE/t, turbine 30 FE/t, compact large solar 64 FE/t and 3x3 solar array 576 FE/t.
guide.nexustech.page.energia.6=Furnace-fuel generator: 40 FE/t while burning. Lava generator: 40 FE/t for 1,000 ticks per bucket, totaling 40,000 FE. Both pause burning if the buffer lacks space.
guide.nexustech.page.energia.7=Basic battery holds 100,000 FE; advanced 1,000,000 FE; elite 10,000,000 FE. Advanced and elite are passive: a compatible device must push or pull energy.
guide.nexustech.page.energia.8=3x3 solar not generating? Check for incomplete structure, unloaded chunk, overlap, no sun or obstructed sky. The compact panel also stops in rain or without sky access.
guide.nexustech.page.processamento.7=Electric furnace, electric crusher and compressor use 20 FE per working tick and 200 ticks per operation: 4,000 FE. Low power pauses progress; blocked output may reset it.
guide.nexustech.page.processamento.8=Press and alloy smelter use 20 FE per tick for 100 ticks: 2,000 FE per operation. They accept compatible Ore Dictionary ingots without extra tags or damage.
guide.nexustech.page.processamento.9=Sawmill, composter and bottler use 20 FE per tick for 80 ticks: 1,600 FE per operation. The bottler needs adjacent vanilla source water; also check its output.
guide.nexustech.page.processamento.10=In the compressor, use coal, not charcoal. In the composter, gather 8 matching wheat, beetroot, melon or pumpkin seeds, or vanilla saplings of the same species.
guide.nexustech.page.automacao.6=In the harvester GUI, put the Speed Upgrade in its dedicated slot. Without upgrades it checks up to 8 positions every 20 ticks; with 50, every 5 ticks. This does not guarantee 8 harvests.
guide.nexustech.page.automacao.7=Each successful harvest costs 200 FE. If it does not harvest, check mature compatible crops, output space, power, loaded chunks, permissions and the doTileDrops rule.
